Algorithms for Many -Objective Optimization Problems ”, ECTI-Transactions on
Computer and Information Technology, Vol. 12, No. 1.
2. Sooktip, T. and Wattananpongsakorn, N., 2017, “A Decision Making Approach for MultiObjective Optimization Considering A Trade -Off Method ”, ECTI-Transactions on
Computer and Information Technology, Vol. 11, No. 2.
3. Mahdavian, M., Sudeng, S. and Wattanapongsakorn, N., 2017, “Multi-objective
Optimization and Decision Making for Greenhouse Climate Control System
