อนุมัติจากสภามจธ.ครั้งที่ 257 (6 ม.ค. 64)

5. Understand in detail a wide range of lengthy, complex texts likely to be encountered

in social, professional or academic life, and then appropriately translate those texts
into Thai.

6. Appropriately translate Thai sentences into English using accurate sentence structures

and grammar including accurate word choice.

7. Appropriately translate Thai texts into English using accurate sentence structures and

grammar including accurate word choice, expressions and idioms.

8. Have responsibility and conform to ethical standards

