4. Explain the concepts of differential calculus of functions of two or more

variables, continuity, partial differentiation, chain rule, Implicit differentiation

5. Find anti-derivatives by using standard techniques

6. Describe how the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus can be used both to

evaluate integrals and to define new functions, and determine their basic
properties

7. Apply calculus concepts in related rates, minimum and maximum problems,

graph sketching, area, and volume

