Principles and techniques used to create functionally correct, easy to use,
robust, reliable, and maintainable software systems . Phases of the software
development lifecycle, focusing on practical approaches. Team-based collaborative
term project that requires students to analyze a proposed software system and
produce a set of development artifacts typical of a real - world software
development project
